              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BRIDGET"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family loved this. I made it for Thanksgiving and served it in place of cranberry salad. Everyone raved, EVEN the teenagers. I will make this again, and it was sooo easy. The only thing I added, was a little butter on top"
          },
