            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kristin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "First time making this, I made a double. I omitted the lemon juice, figured there was no need for it. Instead of 1/4 of butter I added 1/2 cup and I melted it. Had a separate oat mix for a bottom, to make a crust. Cut the apples into cubes, instead of thin slices. I also mixed the crushed pineapple and cranberry sauce with the apples. Did the top oat crumble with 1/2 cup of melted butter. Turned out amazing.",
