            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gauchadeutsche"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This made a great, easy Sunday dessert! I chopped up three apples, and mixed a can of pineapple with a can of whole berry cranberry sauce. I also added coconut and almonds to the top, and it was crunchy, sweet, tart, and delicious. :)",
            "datePublished": "2010-01-24T18:18:33.950Z"
          },
          {
