            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JARRIE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was really good. I substituted peaches for the cranberry sauce (because it's what I had) and I served it with ice cream. I was skeptical of the amount of topping vs butter, but it worked out deliciously :-) I will definitely make this again, I can see it being a quick &amp; tasty way to use up all sorts of fresh fruits before they go bad.",
